# Diabetes Foot Risk Prediction Model — Google Colab walkthrough

This notebook is **Python-only**: it loads the upstream `.rds` model using the pure-Python `rdata` library. You do not need to install or write R code. Follow the cells in order.

> **Clinical safety and privacy:** This is a research/educational demonstration, not a medical device or diagnosis. Do not use its output to make individual care decisions. Do not upload identifiable or confidential patient data to hosted Colab; use only approved, de-identified data and your organization's policies.

