Open in [Google Colab](https://colab.research.google.com/github/contrivancecompanychicago/pirddiiqlabdecisions/blob/main/notebooks/diabetes_foot_risk_colab.ipynb). Choose a standard CPU runtime. The runtime is temporary; generated files disappear when it disconnects.

